<section image-layout="blank" id="zIAo5q7_op" card-margin-hidden="true"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/VZirmFo1IbR28GsLN7qlJ.png" saved-media-id="scipri4bf13d48y" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty photograph of an adult Black model in profile on the right side of the frame, sculptural natural hair forming a fully visible graphic silhouette against an uncluttered gallery-cream studio, restrained oxblood wardrobe, warm directional light, realistic strand detail and subtle film grain, broad quiet cream space on the left, no hands near the hair, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"><freeform><box type="content" x="58" y="68" w="420"><p role="eyebrow">THE NEW SHAPE / CONCEPT EDIT</p><h1 font-size="64pt">Shape, in Motion</h1><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><p font-size="lg">Six directions in line, movement and texture. Replace with approved salon photography and service names before publishing.</p></box><box type="content" x="58" y="478" w="330"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></box></freeform></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="WFc5E0er-f"><freeform><box type="image" x="400" y="30" w="500" h="480" src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/RJN9pnsXKsyUCMpZP05yD.png"></box><shape preset="line" x="58" y="244" w="98" h="1" stroke="accent" stroke-width="2"></shape><box type="content" x="58" y="72" w="300"><h1 font-size="40pt">CUT 01 /<br>The Contour Bob</h1></box><box type="content" x="58" y="276" w="300"><p>A jaw-length, one-line perimeter sharpens the profile; invisible internal layers keep the ends from reading heavy. Precision outside, movement within.</p></box><box type="content" x="58" y="478" w="300"><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></box></freeform></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="C8afMFxTGC"><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="DCluKWvEei" background-color="surface" padding="44pt 28pt 40pt 48pt" colspan="18"><h2>CUT 02 / The Veil</h2><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><p>Curtain fringe opens at the cheekbone; long face-framing layers merge into a soft U-shaped length. The effect is fluid rather than heavily feathered.</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="dFfnL3OcNb" padding="0" colspan="21"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/4XRcKtRNpKUm_qwVRZDFr.png" saved-media-id="ypnpg14vja50kke" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty photograph of an adult South Asian model facing forward with long dark hair fully visible, curtain fringe opening precisely at both cheekbones and merging into restrained face-framing layers, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, rose-clay wardrobe, realistic strands and subtle film grain, no hands or accessories near the hair, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="fDqcuZmvmj" padding="0" colspan="21"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/w4hvbydE9QGGg90Ugmoxb.png" saved-media-id="2gczhlqirlzzvwt" source="image.ai-generated" background="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty photograph of an adult South Asian model in three-quarter view with long dark hair fully visible, soft U-shaped length and cheekbone-opening curtain fringe shown from crown to ends, fluid unforced layers without heavy feathering, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, restrained rose-clay wardrobe, realistic strands and subtle film grain, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="Rxqxkbjien"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="-QKPGHxFk2" padding="0" rowspan="42"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/hR9iDhgG4YLEP0nZ9F7er.png" saved-media-id="n8sjj2wkx6jo0uh" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Panoramic medium-format fashion beauty photograph of an adult model with a short air cut turning from profile toward camera, closely tapered nape fully visible beneath airy crown length, fast shutter freezing piece-by-piece strand separation as the layers lift and settle, clear structure without decorative motion blur, warm directional studio light, uncluttered gallery-cream background, restrained espresso wardrobe, subtle film grain, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="NOV66iLJEx" background-color="surface" padding="20pt 52pt 18pt" rowspan="18"><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="U8v4UMbCnf" vertical-align="center" colspan="25"><h2>MOVEMENT 01 / The Air Cut</h2></grid-item><grid-item id="izf2hD4XJT" vertical-align="center" colspan="35"><p>A tapered nape supports airy length through the crown. Piece-by-piece separation turns short hair into a shifting silhouette rather than a fixed crop.</p><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="eM-e-e61AX"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="ir0VD4FE1k" padding="0" colspan="38"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/-yzAQBppAjftaZBkeWD5b.png" saved-media-id="pgbc223exi9xvpk" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Full-height medium-format fashion beauty portrait of an adult Latino model with a soft shoulder-length shag, short crown layers visibly releasing loose movement while the longer perimeter remains intact, broken fringe opening lightly across the forehead, hair fully visible from crown to ends, warm directional studio light, uncluttered gallery-cream background, restrained oxblood wardrobe, realistic strands and subtle film grain, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="xRaOniD3B9" vertical-align="center" padding="56pt 46pt" colspan="22"><h1 font-size="40pt">MOVEMENT 02 /<br>The Soft Shag</h1><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><p>Short crown layers release movement while a longer perimeter preserves length. A broken fringe keeps the outline light, loose and wearable.</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="t8YIu8OYQ9"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="6FkQQdVFkc" padding="0" colspan="34"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/tZiq_7AB2r4NRIlL_9Vw2.png" saved-media-id="1z5kqm6kx7lbhvu" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Full editorial portrait of an adult Black model with a rounded halo of tightly coiled natural hair fully visible around the face and crown, balanced volume with believable curl-by-curl variation, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, restrained rose-clay wardrobe, realistic strand detail and subtle film grain, no plastic smoothing, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item><grid-item id="6utAsrk4kw" padding="0" colspan="26"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="oV6OtO_hlF" padding="0" rowspan="33"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/IhVY13z0_LXO7G5MowvUW.png" saved-media-id="jr7e9k75knm7q8t" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Macro medium-format beauty photograph of tightly coiled natural hair from the halo portrait, showing distinct curl clusters, fine flyaways and varied strand pattern under warm directional studio light, gallery-cream and espresso palette, realistic texture without plastic smoothing, subtle film grain, no face crop that obscures the hair structure, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="m4F3BCBO5B" background-color="surface" padding="24pt 28pt" rowspan="27"><h2 font-size="26pt">TEXTURE 01 / The Halo</h2><p>Rounded shaping balances volume around the face while curl-by-curl definition preserves natural variation. The silhouette feels intentional; the texture stays alive.</p><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="8nlD7sTe6J"><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none"><grid-item id="avCHQBX0lO" padding="0" rowspan="43"><grid spacing="small"><grid-item id="qhRm4aFE0F" padding="0" colspan="44"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/SlITf2AE2l_qpw1M3vARl.png" saved-media-id="qi6mwi6h1rtxryh" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Medium-format fashion beauty profile of an adult Black model with clean scalp sections directing precise braids toward a low sculpted knot, softly released ends visible against the neck, the full braided pattern and profile unobstructed, warm directional studio light, uncluttered gallery-cream background, restrained espresso wardrobe, realistic braid and strand detail, subtle film grain, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="djV_lArcjg" padding="0" colspan="16"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/U66HeKc6y4jXnItVRSaVz.png" saved-media-id="egkrplumffru575" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Close editorial detail photograph of clean braided sections converging toward a low knot with a few softly released ends interrupting the geometry, realistic tension and individual strand detail under warm directional studio light, gallery-cream and oxblood palette, subtle film grain, no plastic smoothing, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid></grid-item><grid-item id="qRoVgcKXJ9" padding="18pt 52pt" rowspan="17"><grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item id="GWThu375Np" vertical-align="center" colspan="24"><h2 font-size="28pt">TEXTURE 02 / The Sculpted Braid</h2></grid-item><grid-item id="QeaF8hqOPM" vertical-align="center" colspan="36"><p>Clean sections direct braided lines toward a low knot; softly released ends interrupt the geometry. Structured pattern meets a touchable editorial finish.</p><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>
<section image-layout="blank" id="W99XDV8kta"><grid divider="sm neutral-border"><grid-item id="dFXyE91bl3" vertical-align="center" padding="58pt 42pt 48pt 56pt" colspan="24"><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><h1>Start with One Cue</h1><p font-size="lg">Bring one reference: a line, a movement or a texture. A stylist can translate that cue into a wearable plan.</p><spacer mode="fill"></spacer><p role="caption">AI concept imagery — not salon work.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="FAWwt83V-j" background-color="surface" vertical-align="center" padding="32pt" colspan="36"><grid spacing="small" vertical-sizing="hug" image-aspect="landscape" image-shape="square"><grid-item id="B1IXuBUJDh" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/I5xUgaHYUpUHPeosL3zkN.png" saved-media-id="ka9fs1i1uilj8ks" source="image.ai-generated" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Contact-sheet beauty frame of an adult East Asian model in profile, isolating the exact jaw-length line of a contour bob against gallery cream, warm directional studio light, realistic strands, restrained wardrobe and subtle film grain, hair fully visible, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="Ur_NIdqKDh" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/S9Mbirczw97xfF62U2wG9.png" saved-media-id="jimscr5d3pftoy7" source="image.ai-generated" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Contact-sheet beauty frame of an adult South Asian model in three-quarter view, isolating curtain fringe opening at the cheekbone and merging into long face-framing layers, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, realistic strands and subtle film grain, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="ZXtDsArDDh" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/PfOI2_4Z0UTronHrexSM3.png" saved-media-id="00sq6h3h12yh23j" source="image.ai-generated" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Contact-sheet beauty frame of an adult Black model showing rounded natural curl volume beside the face, distinct curl clusters and realistic variation under warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, restrained wardrobe and subtle film grain, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item><grid-item id="hltHAB9y9J" colspan="30"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/BZGOk7qQd-AtJ5EJGH-eX.png" saved-media-id="fjvs9fpfniogrw0" source="image.ai-generated" image-style="sculptural-hair-editorial" alt="Contact-sheet beauty frame of an adult Black model in profile showing clean braided lines converging toward a low sculpted knot with softly released ends, warm directional studio light, gallery-cream background, realistic braid detail and subtle film grain, no hands, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1920,&quot;height&quot;:1088}"></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>